Package: myphotodiary-backend
Version: [[version]]-1
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless, ffmpeg
Maintainer: Marc Lamberton <321042643+marc-mada@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: myPhotoDiary backend (Spring Boot)
 REST API backend for myPhotoDiary: the photo/video gallery for families. It
 takes care of your database of images and short videos, and provides Web
 publishing, photo/video browsing, tagging, rating, commenting, sharing, and
 rich search features. Your assets are protected by strong access control
 (RBAC). It embeds a database to make deployment easy, and only relies on an
 external web server (Caddy recommended) to serve its frontend static files
 and to forward REST API requests to the backend.
